refsect1.para:
The log level of udevd is taken from the following, where a later one takes
    precedence over the earlier ones: the default, info;
    systemd.log_level= or debug on the kernel command line;
    $UDEV_LOG_LEVEL or $SYSTEMD_LOG_LEVEL;
    udev_log= in
    udev.conf5;
    --debug; udev.log_level= on the kernel command line; and
    udevadm control --log-level=. Trace logging, with
    udev.trace or udevadm control --trace, logs at the debug level
    regardless of them.
